        "original_id": "51fea57f-4ce9-5fa6-aa4a-8b6868c38e55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Angelo Francesco Lavagnino, Orson Welles\n- Films: Legend of the Lost, Conspiracy of Hearts, Gorgo, The Legion's Last Patrol, Daisy Miller, Othello, Chimes at Midnight, Falstaff (Chimes at Midnight), Campanadas a medianoche\n- Topics: film scores, film titles, film production\n\nFacts:\n- Angelo Francesco Lavagnino is best known for scoring many films, including Legend of the Lost, Conspiracy of Hearts, Gorgo, The Legion's Last Patrol, Daisy Miller, Othello, and Chimes at Midnight.\n- Angelo Francesco Lavagnino scored Othello and Chimes at Midnight, which were both directed by Orson Welles.\n- Chimes at Midnight is a 1965 English-language Spanish-Swiss co-produced film directed by and starring Orson Welles.\n- Chimes at Midnight had the onscreen and UK title Falstaff (Chimes at Midnight) and the Spanish release title Campanadas a medianoche.",
